    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Game Objectives</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Create</u> circuits to <u>solve</u> each challenge\u00a0level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Progress</u> and unlock  harder problems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Design</u>   more and more complex solutions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/9868f3f7241157345aacaf9534091527.poster.avif?t=1752363043\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/9868f3f7241157345aacaf9534091527.webm?t=1752363043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/9868f3f7241157345aacaf9534091527.mp4?t=1752363043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Interactive Pixel Art</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Draw</u> your <u>colourful</u> circuit (as an image!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Simulate</u> it at any time with a button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Toggle</u> wires (zeros and ones) by clicking on it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/203cde6679942f6959c8bb36befe4cbd.poster.avif?t=1752363043\" width=657 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/203cde6679942f6959c8bb36befe4cbd.webm?t=1752363043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Circuit Simulation Rules</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little pixel triangles are <u>NANDs</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Black pixels are background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything else is a <u>wire</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn From Zero By Doing</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game includes a <u>Tutorial</u> wiki introducing most important <u>building blocks</u> in digital logic circuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be used as an introduction or helper for the challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play in Sandbox Mode / Create your Interface to Your Circuit</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play in <u>Sandbox mode</u> to create your own circuits.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or you can <u>create your own levels</u> and interact with your circuit via lua scripts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open Source</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is also open source! You can find it in <u>github</u> if you want to dig into simulation or tweak it up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoyed the game, mind getting it on steam too to support the developer ;).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit Artist is written in C language using Raylib with scripting in Lua.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/acf3c932de1ce5b7abbf6c205aa020a6.avif?t=1752363043\" width=160 height=188 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community at discord to share circuits or ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/cf164908d2ac6830afe91e13070647eb.avif?t=1752363043\" width=256 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WARNING</i></strong><i>: This game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy (flashing lights). Player discretion is advised </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Game Objectives</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Create</u> circuits to <u>solve</u> each challenge\u00a0level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Progress</u> and unlock  harder problems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Design</u>   more and more complex solutions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/9868f3f7241157345aacaf9534091527.poster.avif?t=1752363043\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/9868f3f7241157345aacaf9534091527.webm?t=1752363043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/9868f3f7241157345aacaf9534091527.mp4?t=1752363043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Interactive Pixel Art</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Draw</u> your <u>colourful</u> circuit (as an image!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Simulate</u> it at any time with a button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Toggle</u> wires (zeros and ones) by clicking on it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/203cde6679942f6959c8bb36befe4cbd.poster.avif?t=1752363043\" width=657 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/203cde6679942f6959c8bb36befe4cbd.webm?t=1752363043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Circuit Simulation Rules</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little pixel triangles are <u>NANDs</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Black pixels are background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything else is a <u>wire</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn From Zero By Doing</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game includes a <u>Tutorial</u> wiki introducing most important <u>building blocks</u> in digital logic circuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be used as an introduction or helper for the challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play in Sandbox Mode / Create your Interface to Your Circuit</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play in <u>Sandbox mode</u> to create your own circuits.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or you can <u>create your own levels</u> and interact with your circuit via lua scripts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open Source</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is also open source! You can find it in <u>github</u> if you want to dig into simulation or tweak it up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoyed the game, mind getting it on steam too to support the developer ;).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit Artist is written in C language using Raylib with scripting in Lua.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/acf3c932de1ce5b7abbf6c205aa020a6.avif?t=1752363043\" width=160 height=188 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our community at discord to share circuits or ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139580/extras/cf164908d2ac6830afe91e13070647eb.avif?t=1752363043\" width=256 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WARNING</i></strong><i>: This game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy (flashing lights). Player discretion is advised </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
